cmd-panicbunker_deny_vpn-desc = Enables or disables denying access via VPN connections.
cmd-panicbunker_deny_vpn-help = Usage: panicbunker_min_overall_hours <bool>
panicbunker-command-deny-vpn-enabled = The bunker mode will now block connections via VPN.
panicbunker-command-deny-vpn-disabled = The bunker mode will no longer block connections via VPN.
